\f0\b\fs32 \cf0 1. Design Vision\
Product Vision\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs26 \cf0 ClockUp is 
\f0\b not an attendance management application
\f1\b0 .\
It is a 
\f0\b personal productivity companion
\f1\b0  that helps employees build consistency, track progress, and feel rewarded for completing their workday.\
The interface should never feel like HR is monitoring the user.\
Instead, it should feel like:\
"I'm tracking my own progress."\
\
\pard\pardeftab560\sa40\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs32 \cf0 2. Design Principles\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs26 \cf0 Every design decision should follow these principles.\
\pard\pardeftab560\sa40\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs32 \cf0 1. Calm\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs26 \cf0 No visual clutter.\
Lots of whitespace.\
Easy scanning.\
\
\pard\pardeftab560\sa40\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs32 \cf0 2. Motivating\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs26 \cf0 Reward effort.\
Celebrate achievements.\
Avoid punishment.\
\
\pard\pardeftab560\sa40\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs32 \cf0 3. Professional\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs26 \cf0 Corporate users should immediately trust the application.\
No cartoon graphics.\
No childish illustrations.\
\
\pard\pardeftab560\sa40\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs32 \cf0 4. Premium\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs26 \cf0 Every interaction should feel polished.\
Inspired by Apple and Linear.\
\
\pard\pardeftab560\sa40\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs32 \cf0 5. Functional\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs26 \cf0 Information should always be more important than decoration.\
\
\pard\pardeftab560\sa40\partightenfactor0

