\f0\b\fs32 \cf0 30. Overall Design Philosophy\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs26 \cf0 If someone uses ClockUp for the first time, they should think:\
"This feels more like Apple Fitness or Linear than a traditional attendance application."\
The application should make employees feel 
\f0\b motivated
\f1\b0 , 
\f0\b organized
\f1\b0 , and 
\f0\b in control of their workday
\f1\b0 , rather than feeling monitored by their employer.\
\
\
\
